   </table><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;" id="item_5_or_information"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Item 5 - Othe</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">r Information</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_4771ecdd-8122-4118-a1a0-94ddf3c31191" contextRef="C_2042a9ae-6936-40dc-91c4-d3cadc613807" name="ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock" escape="true"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">On </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_35957a80-6be5-47d4-b529-2b04bdff2b66" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:TrdArrTerminationDate"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">May 26, 2026</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_1766725c-518c-43c2-b64f-2ed4b36054ea" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:TrdArrIndName"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Katherine Scherping</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, a former </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_2dc41001-e129-4fe3-985f-9d0b8f8e10b1" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:TrdArrIndTitle"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">member of the Board</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> who was serving as a director at the time of the termination, </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_836d95b1-7815-49ca-9f8d-57a005201530" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-true"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">terminated </span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">a Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement that was intended to satisfy the affirmative defense under Rule 10b5-1(c) under the Exchange Act (such arrangement, a &#8220;10b5-1 Plan&#8221;). Ms. Scherping </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_4420aecf-eeb2-405b-acf1-9d692c777d1f" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-true"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">adopted</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> the 10b5-1 Plan on </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_850d5c16-585a-4ebd-9adb-944b7fe89201" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:TrdArrAdoptionDate"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">March 23, 2026</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, and the plan provided for the sale of up to </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_7a5a87b6-5f06-497d-8dad-96aff6b3ff93" contextRef="C_452461ad-36ee-47fb-8bd5-a8320a18706f" name="ecd:TrdArrSecuritiesAggAvailAmt" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">13,465</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> shares of common stock through </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_71cbd4c4-0b49-4736-a3de-8d2164cfa4d3" contextRef="C_ac844af0-4f24-4631-8bf4-3111f9f3d041" name="ecd:TrdArrExpirationDate"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">March 23, 2027</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">. No shares of common stock were sold pursuant to the 10b5-1 Plan prior to its termination.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Except as described above, none of our other directors or executive officers </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_a8124901-1f11-4671-99e0-27444c6df9d3" contextRef="C_2042a9ae-6936-40dc-91c4-d3cadc613807" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_5d568132-ee35-4d0c-b99d-9abcb644da11" contextRef="C_2042a9ae-6936-40dc-91c4-d3cadc613807" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">adopted</span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> or </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_1430d7be-264a-46b2-b3f9-030d52fe3af1" contextRef="C_2042a9ae-6936-40dc-91c4-d3cadc613807" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_41de3704-3131-4c81-ad54-a89e2196768a" contextRef="C_2042a9ae-6936-40dc-91c4-d3cadc613807" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">terminated</span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> a 10b5-1 Plan, or a "non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement" (as each term is defined in Item 408 of Regulation S-K) during the three months ended</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> June 30, 2026</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
